# This repo uses one env file PER APP, not one at the root:
#
#   frontend/.env.example  -> copy to frontend/.env.local   (public values only, VITE_ prefix)
#   backend/.env.example   -> copy to backend/.env          (server secrets)
#
# Why: Vite only reads env files inside frontend/, and anything prefixed VITE_
# is bundled into the public website. Keeping them apart makes it hard to
# accidentally ship the Supabase service-role key to browsers.
